WEBVTT

00:07:00.499 --> 00:07:03.794
A white male physician
was sent to evaluate her,

00:07:03.794 --> 00:07:07.256
and he concluded that she
was experiencing dementia,

00:07:07.298 --> 00:07:13.429
citing that she was "imagining
being discriminated against."

00:07:13.429 --> 00:07:15.556
(Audience murmurs)

00:07:15.931 --> 00:07:17.183
As a result,

00:07:17.224 --> 00:07:20.478
she was institutionalized against her will

00:07:20.478 --> 00:07:23.898
for around 25 years.

00:07:26.025 --> 00:07:28.486
Each of her children were taken from her

00:07:28.486 --> 00:07:31.113
and they were placed
into separate foster homes.